{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"dockerfile","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Dockerfile","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Dockerfile (.dockerfile).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"dockerfile","name":"Dockerfile","extensions":[".dockerfile"],"grammar":"grammars/dockerfile.json","filenames":["Dockerfile","Containerfile"],"lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Dockerfile","path":"snippets/dockerfile.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/dockerfile.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\{?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\}?\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"--[a-z-]+\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:HEALTHCHECK|ENTRYPOINT|MAINTAINER|STOPSIGNAL|ONBUILD|WORKDIR|EXPOSE|VOLUME|LABEL|SHELL|COPY|FROM|USER|ADD|ARG|CMD|ENV|RUN|AS)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/dockerfile.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Node app\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"node\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"FROM node:${1:22}-alpine\",\n      \"WORKDIR /app\",\n      \"COPY package*.json ./\",\n      \"RUN npm ci --omit=dev\",\n      \"COPY . .\",\n      \"CMD [\\\"node\\\", \\\"${2:index.js}\\\"]\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Node.js image\"\n  },\n  \"Multi-stage build\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"multi\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"FROM ${1:node:22} AS build\",\n      \"WORKDIR /src\",\n      \"COPY . .\",\n      \"RUN ${2:npm run build}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"FROM ${3:nginx:alpine}\",\n      \"COPY --from=build /src/${4:dist} /usr/share/nginx/html\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A multi-stage build\"\n  },\n  \"Healthcheck\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"health\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=3s CMD ${1:curl -f http://localhost/ || exit 1}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A health check\"\n  },\n  \"Non-root user\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"user\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"RUN adduser -D app\",\n      \"USER app\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Run as a normal user\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Dockerfile\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Dockerfile.\n\n## Files\n\n`.dockerfile`, `Dockerfile`, `Containerfile`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `node` | A Node.js image |\n| `multi` | A multi-stage build |\n| `health` | A health check |\n| `user` | Run as a normal user |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}